                <text type="warning_situation">
				<p>MINOR FLOODING POSSIBLE AT OAKBANK FROM EARLY TUESDAY MORNING WITH FORECAST RAINFALL</p>

				<p/>
				<p>Moderate to possibly locally heavy falls are forecast about the Onkaparinga catchment during the remainder of Monday and into Tuesday. This forecast rainfall may cause minor flooding along the Onkaparinga River at Oakbank from early Tuesday morning.</p>

				<p/>

                </text>
